@startuml architecture_overview
title Interfaces, implementations, and dependency injection

hide members
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam nodesep 40
skinparam ranksep 50

class "main.cpp" as Main <<composition root>>
class Application

interface IBodyDatabase
interface IConstellationCalculator
interface IReportFormatter
interface IOrbitalMechanics
interface ITimeFormatter

class KspBodyDatabase <<final>>
class ConstellationCalculator <<final>>
class ConsoleReportFormatter <<final>>
class OrbitalMechanics <<final>>
class KerbinTimeFormatter <<final>>

Main ..> Application : constructs & injects
Application --> IBodyDatabase
Application --> IConstellationCalculator
Application --> IReportFormatter

IBodyDatabase <|.. KspBodyDatabase
IConstellationCalculator <|.. ConstellationCalculator
IReportFormatter <|.. ConsoleReportFormatter

ConstellationCalculator --> IOrbitalMechanics
ConsoleReportFormatter --> ITimeFormatter

IOrbitalMechanics <|.. OrbitalMechanics
ITimeFormatter <|.. KerbinTimeFormatter

note right of Application
  Interactive loop:
  body → altitude → calculate → report
end note
@enduml
